# Reverb tank trace (generated by tools/mame_ref/analysis/make_reverb_tank_trace.py;
# edit the generator, not this file). Synthetic data only.
# ESP: the reverb of tests/test_esp_programs.cpp (4 lattice allpasses + 4453-sample tank,
# feedback 0.7). Input: an impulse on SER0L from two one-shot OTIS voices on CA 1.
# Main L = wet (SER3L), main R = diffusers only (SER3R). 1785714 frames = 60.0 s.
# Decay times: docs/verification-plan1.md (tools/mame_ref/analysis/decay_time.py).
